Crystal cod_1501802 holds heavy elements C, O and S in occupied CIF sites, taken over occupied nonhydrogen periodic-image sites. Apply the space-group operations together with translations in [-1,1]^3, excluding the identity image.

Identify and measure the nearest nonidentity periodic atom pair. Inspect and measure the nearest periodic pair. Resolve the periodic-image atom, record the periodic-contact element pair, resolve the asymmetric-unit source atom, resolve the nonidentity symmetry operation and compute unit-cell volume.

**Answer format**

```json
{
  "targets": {
    "sv-chem-chem_crystallography-0000": {
      "image_atom_id": <object>,
      "nearest_contact_element_pair": <list>,
      "source_atom_id": <object>,
      "symmetry_operation": <string>,
      "unit_cell_volume_A3": <number>
    }
  }
}
```

